regel-screensaver (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.5.0: Wave-Optics Diffraction, Deliot & Belcour 2023 Binomial
    Glints, GPU Power Optimization, and Long-Running Precision Hardening.
  * Pure-ALU Glint BRDF (Deliot & Belcour, HPG 2023): Replaced Chermain et al.
    2020 dictionary texture lookups with O(1) constant-time distributed binomial
    laws on an equilateral simplex grid with variance-preserving 2-LOD blending,
    eliminating u_glint_dict texture memory and lookups.
  * Thin-Film Iridescence (Belcour & Barla, SIGGRAPH 2017): Upgraded stone
    iridescence to multi-bounce Airy reflectance integrated against O(1)
    pre-scaled CIE XYZ Gaussian sensitivity curves.
  * Multi-Order Kirchhoff Diffraction Gratings (Stam 1999 / Toisoul & Ghosh
    SIGGRAPH 2017): Upgraded holographic CD and hybrid stickers with physical
    L+V grating dispersion across orders m=1..4 and analytic CIE 1931 XYZ
    spectral-to-RGB color conversion (Wyman et al., JCGT 2013).
  * Optical Bloom & Tone Mapping: Added analytical in-shader specular flare
    halos and soft-shoulder highlight tone mapping for high-contrast glints.
  * Long-Running Precision Hardening: Added 64-bit CPU-wrapped skewed simplex
    glitter scroll (mod 4096.0), scroll-free screen derivatives, sine-free
    hash22 synchronized between QML and GLSL, periodic mod 256.0 noise2D,
    wrapped trigonometric phases, and harmonic f32 clock wrapping in
    regel-engine.
  * GPU Power & Thermal Optimization: Resolved QML binding loops, optimized
    idle lifecycle, and added patterned mineral veins and 8 procedural
    holographic sticker archetypes across 3 foil modes.

 -- Regel Project Contributors <info@regel.org>  Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:45:00 -0500

regel-screensaver (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.4.0: Concept 09 - The Embossed Glyph Matrix & Live Typography.
  * Concept 09: Bas-relief stone inscription and shifting material monolith
    with 108 procedural signed distance field (SDF) glyphs spanning runes,
    alchemical sigils, cuneiform, Greek, math, circuitry, and typography.
  * Security Holo Stickers: Procedural tamper-evident holographic foil seals
    with multi-order thin-film diffraction grating, micro-embossed security
    patterns, dynamic glitter flake orientation, and persistent off-screen
    lifecycle management.
  * Live Fortune & Monumental Typography: Integrated `/usr/games/fortune`
    with fallback pool of 42 philosophical maxims and 6 typographic font
    profiles in golden ratio portrait layout.
  * Off-screen Deferral Queue: Mathematically verified single-fortune layout
    with reactive queueing that defers updates until the active tablet
    scrolls completely off screen to prevent mid-screen text shifts.
  * PipeWire D-Bus IPC: Added 'fortune' string property and PropertiesChanged
    signal emission in regel-daemon, bound reactively into Plasma wallpaper
    and widget frontends.
  * Concept 03 (The Tranquil Sanctuary): Added drifting resonant lily pads
    with gentle attack-decay audio envelope and 12-variety koi migration pool.
  * Upgraded developer harness runner and headless RHI capture tools.

 -- Regel Project Contributors <info@regel.org>  Sun, 04 Oct 2026 22:35:00 -0400

regel-screensaver (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v0.3.1: Hydrodynamic Stability & Interaction Pacing Fix.
  * Concept 3 (The Tranquil Sanctuary): Stabilize water surface normal
    refraction with central finite differences, calm high-frequency pointer
    wake ripples, and soften predator boid panic steering.
  * Concept 3: Balance swim cadence scaling at low vortex speeds to prevent
    frozen animation on wallpaper containment.
  * Shared Cursor Interaction: Add pointer velocity exponential decay across
    plasmoid widget, desktop wallpaper, lockscreen, and Rust engine core.
  * Eliminate cursor entry impulse spike and normalize velocity tracking
    across standard and 4K display resolutions.

